    "user_request_original": "Design a 24-layer chirped dielectric coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: air / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / hfo2 / SiO2 (Lemarchand) / SiO2 (Lemarchand)_substrate. Optimize all 24 layer thicknesses with a chirp progression (thickness varies systematically through stack depth) to maximize reflectance in 300-450 nm band and transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band. Use only hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) materials. Maximum 30 layers constraint satisfied with 24 layers.",
